	<td width="100%" align="left" valign="top">
		<div>Well today the evil eye bag was fixed so i was thinking of writing down quick what to do in it.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>The quest is 32+ and starts at the goblin Foomby near Tagglefoot Farm in Enchanted lands, the reward is a 20slot 30%reduction bag&nbsp;(Bag of Sewn Evil Eye)&nbsp;+ 2gold + 45000status points and some to guild.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>1. First of is to kill darkflight fairies and there is both solo and group and they are easy to kill, they spawn south of the farm. When you find the item your suppose to find go back to foomby for next part.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>2. Now it is time to kill the big fish in lake who ate the part you want, so move to the lake to south and get Chomper to spawn (this was boring and slow part). Kill him and return to foomby and he tells you he didnt find the last part so he sends you to find it.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>3. He tells you to go get a part from someone (forgot the name) but she is in the house where you start race for legendary jboots, the house is straight out and little to left of docks. Talk to her and she tells you she doesnt have it and that a named nighblood has it and how you will get this nightblood to spawn. Go back near farm and kill 15lamias in 20mins (easy to do so no hurry), then the named guy will spawn near nightblood tower, kill him and get the part.</div><div>Now return to the little house and talk to the girl and you will get almost 2gold as reward, then run back to foomby and get your new nice bag.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Good luck on it, and sry for misspell and the short walkthrough, hope it helps a little atleast.</div>
