	<td width="100%" align="left" valign="top">
		<div>Walk through for the Glowing Black Stone,&nbsp;&nbsp; going from memory so the names of NPC&#39;s will not be given.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Step 1</div><div>Speak with the Conjurer located behind the Oracle Tower in Antonica at level 25 or higher.&nbsp;&nbsp; He will instruct you to gather 2 light sources from TS and Nek forest.&nbsp; The TS light source is located near the sunken ships near the coast with the Griffons.&nbsp;&nbsp; The Nek source is located near the waterfall.&nbsp;&nbsp; Return to the Conjurer.</div><div>Step 2 </div><div>Enter the Ruins Of Varsoon and vist both rooms that spawn both the Tomb of Life and the Tomb of Death.&nbsp;&nbsp; Each room as a book you can click on to advance the quest.&nbsp; Return to the Conjurer.</div><div>Step 3</div><div>Get&nbsp; a Palladuim Torque and return it to the conjurer.&nbsp;&nbsp; Found in Edgewater, or a crafted item.&nbsp;&nbsp; Can be found for sale on the broker.&nbsp;&nbsp; He will not take the item for you so you can pass it around or resell it after you progress this part of the quest.&nbsp;&nbsp; </div><div>Step 4</div><div>Return to Varsoon and kill the Tomb of Life and the Tomb of Death.&nbsp;&nbsp; Spawned in the same rooms that gave you quest credit to step 2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Not really all that rare of spawns.&nbsp; Return to the conjurer.</div><div>Step 5 </div><div>Kill Varsoon, He is located in the Chamber of Immortality, Level 36 that can be somewhat difficult.&nbsp;&nbsp; To access the Chamber you will need to complete the access quest given by&nbsp;a Barb in the village.&nbsp;&nbsp; Supposdly need two things before he will give the quest.&nbsp;&nbsp; Speak Barbarian,&nbsp; and completed the quest for the hidden entrance to the ruins of varsoon.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The quest for Chamber of immortality is done by speaking to a hermit outside in TS near RoV.&nbsp; He then has you kill 3 named in RoV that spawn in the Sorcerers, Enchanters and conjurers roooms after you clear out the enraged mobs.&nbsp;&nbsp; After killing Varsoon return to the Conjurer near the oracle tower and he will agro.&nbsp;&nbsp; Kill him get the Glowing Black Stone.&nbsp;&nbsp; Very nice item for casters as it adds 8 wis and 8 int,&nbsp;&nbsp; Currently is not no drop and can be traded.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Digler Ragemaster - Nektolus&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://seekersoftruth.eq2guilds.org/" target="_blank"><font color="#c8c1b5">Seekers of Truth</font></a></div>
		<p>
