	<td width="100%" align="left" valign="top">
		<div><font color="#669900">Special note to be prepared:<br />Have a group of friends 40+ with you after part 3 and on.</font></div><div><font color="#669900">The quest estimates about 3hrs long or less if the marks are up.<br />If you fail to find a mark they will pop within 2 hrs after you start the quest.<br />The marks all pop and you have within 2hrs to kill them all before depop.<br />Note the time after each kill incase you lose a mark ahead of you.<br />Feel free to chat me if you get stuck<br />/tell eq2.befallen.rossio</font></div><div><font color="#669900">Parts 1-3<br />The quest starts at Yoru the Old at the Windstalker Village in Antonica.<br />You must be level 40 to start this quest.</font></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><strong><font color="#ff0000">1. Yoru needs some firewood.<br /></font></strong>He sends you out to harvest 10 wood from the logs in Antonica<br />you cannot go to any other zone for this, nor can you buy the wood or trade it off for credit.<br /><strong><font color="#cc6633">Foresting skill must be (20)</font></strong></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><font color="#ff0000"><strong>2. Yoru needs some steak<br /></strong></font>He sends you to make Basil Grilled Deer Steak<br />You need to go to your hometown Society and buy Grilled Deer Steak, Basil &amp; coal<br />and make the steak, <font color="#cc6633"><strong>Tradeskill (5)</strong></font></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><strong><font color="#ff0000">3. Yoru needs you to fetch a flask of ale for him.<br /></font></strong>You need to take the flask on a times trial of 15 mins, The tavern is<br />where the Mender is on the main road to Qeynos on 1st half of map.<br />After you get the flask filled with ale, you get another 15 mins to run back.<br />You will need to have a group with you before turning in ale.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><font color="#ff0000"><strong>4.Yoru wants you to meditate with him.<br /></strong></font>Shortly after pressing &quot;Alright&quot; within 30 seconds bandits will pop out of nowhere<br />and attack you, there is 4 or 5 of them lvl 41.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><font color="#ff0000"><strong>5.Speak to Yoru after Bandits fight.<br /></strong></font>After talking to yoru, He wants you to seek out Cythan.<br />&quot;But you have, you just might not see it yet.&nbsp; You are ready to meet him.&nbsp; <br />Cythan will be waiting for you.&nbsp; <br />Seek him out in the jungles where Fear and War wrestle in the darkness.&quot;<br />Cythan is in ferott, follow the wall keeping to your right till you run into him, about a <br />1 min run from the cave.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><font color="#ff0000"><strong>6. Cythan&#39;s Trial<br /></strong></font>Cythan will spawn a series of mobs you must kill with a group.</div><div>Then let us begin.&nbsp; <br />You will be given a short amount of time to face monks who have passed in this life in battle.&nbsp; <br />You must defeat a specific amount of opponents in your given time to pass this trial.&nbsp; <br />You must engage them, they will not attack you first.&quot;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><font color="#ff0000"><strong>7. After the trial Cythan wants you to seek out the monks of the past<br /></strong></font>and get there mark.<br />The holders of the marks are: <br />Oodan the Tranquil <br />Borbin the Prevailer <br />Brother Raster<br />Sartar the Unrivaled.&nbsp; <br />Look for them in the Misty Thicket, (EL)<br />the residence of the Stouts, (RV)<br />Jagged Pine forest (Zek)<br />and here within the Feerrott.&nbsp; <br />They will appear in their mortal forms until confronted.&nbsp; <br />Present yourself to them and they will accept your challenge.&quot;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><strong><font color="#ff0000">8.Finding the monks of the past.</font></strong><br />1. Burdop - Rivervale behind the house next to the rats up on hill next to tree.<br />2. Lo&#39;volonus - Enchanted lands From the docks Go due north to the other end of the map, he will be there under a tree.<br />3. Forgot his name but he&#39;s Iksar, behind Cazic Thul on the right side where the river runs into the pond, he is next to the tree there.<br />4. Zan - Zek on very top of Deathfist Lookout where the 2 skellies are and the little chest.</div><div>9. After getting all 4 marks talk to Cythan in Ferott.<br />You will have to kill Cythan now. Hes about as hard as the rest of them.<br />After killing him he will spawn again and you talk to him, he tells you to look under the rock<br />right next to him.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Congrats on your new FBSS!</div>
		<p>
