	<td width="100%" align="left" valign="top">
		<div>Step #1 hail the guy in TS at the docks.&nbsp; He is standing behind the building on the left as you face the ocean. </div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Step #2 Go to the Tower in Antonica.&nbsp; It the old broken tower in the side of the mountin with all the bats in it and the ghost on the top.&nbsp; Just just need to run around the bottom to get the update. </div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Step#3 River in Nektulos.&nbsp; Follow the road from the commons zone up to the broken bridge.&nbsp; Then keep going up river on the shore from there until you see rapids.&nbsp; If you get to the lake and Timber falls you went to far.&nbsp; At the bottom of the rapids before the river makes a turn is the update.&nbsp; Swim around int he water to get it, i found it comes easier if you are swimming underwater near the bottom.&nbsp; </div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Step#4 The commonlands ocean.&nbsp; Go to the Ocean out by the wailing caves entrance.&nbsp; You will find a dock down on the coast with a bunch of KOS bad guys around it.&nbsp; Swim out from the dock a bit and then swim down (you need to have underwater breath, its a huge help).&nbsp; You are looking for a huge bahemoth skell like the one on Beaver island in Nektulos.&nbsp; The update is in the head of the skell.&nbsp; All you need to do is swim through it.&nbsp; </div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Step#5 Ocean in Thundering steps.&nbsp; Go to the Ocean out past where the griffins spawn.&nbsp; Go all the way to the left as you are facing the ocean.&nbsp; Again you need underwater breath, also having someone with escape helps here as well.&nbsp; Swim out tell you see a little temple underwater with a bunch of KOS mobs on it (this is NOT the update).&nbsp; To the right of the temple is some island poking out of the water.&nbsp; Swim to them, just past them on the bottom is several ship wrecks.&nbsp; The ships are broken into three pieces, front, middle , and back.&nbsp; The update is in the middle front on the ship.&nbsp; Major agro, sharks and all kinds of things around.&nbsp; Once you get the update a mean Octipus ++ will spawn, this is where escape comes in.&nbsp; If you don&#39;t have escape, well either have a group with you to kill it or take a death in a safe spot where you can get your shard.&nbsp; Invis wont help you, as soon as he pops he is coming after who ever go tht update invis or not.&nbsp; </div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Step#5 Lord Everling in Nek castle.&nbsp; Get a group, kill the boss of Nek Castle in the basement.&nbsp; Normal time to get this done with a full level 27+ group is 3hours.&nbsp; </div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Step#6 Kills named in Ruins of Varsoon.&nbsp; Get a group, same drill as above.&nbsp; Time to finish with full group 27+ is 2 hours. </div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Step#7 look at your cool new earring</div>
		<p>
