		&nbsp;<font color="#6666ff">Dragoon K&#39;Naae </font>spawns up in the Northeast corner of Nektulos forest, if you follow east road from center bridge you will eventually get there.&nbsp; <font color="#ff0000">Do not double click him</font>.&nbsp; You will attack him if you do.&nbsp; Hail him and he will give you quest, &quot;Dragoon K&#39;Naae of the Thexians&quot;.<div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The first part of the quest consists of killing lots of owlbears.&nbsp; He wants 60 owlbear meat.&nbsp; They will come quickly at first but the closer you get to 60 the slower they will drop for you.&nbsp; I ended up killing about 120 or so bears.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; After this you run back up to the <font color="#6633ff">Dragoon K&#39;Naae</font> and give him the meat.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Next, you are required to kill the undead surrounding Nektropos Castle.&nbsp; This includes the golems and the zombies, and he wants 60 pieces of skin from them.&nbsp; Again, like the bears, kill around 100-120.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; After this you take skins back to <font color="#6633ff">Dragoon K&#39;Naae</font>, and get next part.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; He&nbsp;now wants you to bring him water from <font color="#ffff00">Behemoth Pond</font>.&nbsp; <font color="#ffff00">Behemoth Pond </font>is the pond by the giant skele on the beaver island in the southern part of the zone in the middle of the river.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Once you touch the water you have 10 Minutes to return to <font color="#6633ff">Dragoon K&#39;Naae</font>.&nbsp; Should take you about 6-8 minutes to get there.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; When he has recieved the water from Behemoth Pond, he requests you to kill <font color="#6633ff">Captain T&#39;Sanne</font>, the man who took his Shiny Brass Halberd.&nbsp; <font color="#6633ff">Captain T&#39;Sanne </font>spawns at the <font color="#ffff00">Gul&#39;Thex Citadel </font>north of the beach entrance.&nbsp; He&#39;s lvl 26++ with 4 or so adds, one healer.&nbsp; Once he is down you run back to<font color="#6633ff"> Dragoon K&#39;Naae</font>.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <font color="#ff0000">Wait for your group to get to Dragoon before you speak to him</font>.&nbsp; 3 Ebon Assassins that were green + to lvl 32 spawn and attack you.&nbsp; Once these mobs are dead talk to <font color="#6633ff">Dragoon K&#39;Naae</font>.</div>
